{
  "uid": "alerts-overview",
  "title": "Alerts overview",
  "description": "State of every Grafana-managed alert rule, split into prod, nonprod and hub.",
  "tags": [
    "observability-stack",
    "alerts"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 4,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "tier",
        "label": "Tier",
        "type": "custom",
        "description": "prod / nonprod / hub (the alert's tenant label).",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "query": "prod : .+-prod, nonprod : .+-nonprod, hub : aauti-hub",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "prod",
            "value": ".+-prod",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "nonprod",
            "value": ".+-nonprod",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "hub",
            "value": "aauti-hub",
            "selected": false
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "description": "Clusters of the selected tier (All = exactly those clusters).",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "mimir"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(up{__tenant_id__=~\"${tier:pipe}\"}, cluster)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery",
          "qryType": 1
        },
        "definition": "label_values(up{__tenant_id__=~\"${tier:pipe}\"}, cluster)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "regex": "",
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "environment",
        "label": "Environment",
        "type": "custom",
        "description": "Only alerts about a workload carry environment; node / agent / hub alerts have none and show under All only.",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "query": "dev, qa, demo, sandbox, shared, prod",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "dev",
            "value": "dev",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "qa",
            "value": "qa",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "demo",
            "value": "demo",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "sandbox",
            "value": "sandbox",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "shared",
            "value": "shared",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "prod",
            "value": "prod",
            "selected": false
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "Namespace",
        "type": "query",
        "description": "Only workload / PVC alerts carry namespace; node / agent alerts show under All only.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "mimir"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(kube_pod_info{cluster=~\"${cluster:pipe}\"}, namespace)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery",
          "qryType": 1
        },
        "definition": "label_values(kube_pod_info{cluster=~\"${cluster:pipe}\"}, namespace)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "regex": "",
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "severity",
        "label": "Severity",
        "type": "custom",
        "description": "Alert severity label.",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "query": "critical, warning",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "critical",
            "value": "critical",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "warning",
            "value": "warning",
            "selected": false
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Alert rules",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/alerting/list",
      "icon": "bell",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "tooltip": "All alert rules (Alerting -> Alert rules)"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Alerts overview**: every Grafana-managed alert rule (folder *Alerts*, one rule group per cluster; rules as code in `clusters/aauti-hub-as1-obs-gke/grafana/alerting/`). **Pick a Tier at the top**: the panels below repeat once per selected tier (prod, nonprod, hub), so *prod* shows only prod, *nonprod* only nonprod, *All* shows all three. *Environment* and *Namespace* only narrow workload alerts (node, agent and hub alerts carry neither), so keep them on *All* to see everything. Email notifications are not set up yet."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Summary (alert instances per state)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "alertlist",
      "title": "${tier:text}",
      "description": "Alert instances of this tier, by state.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "viewMode": "stat",
        "groupMode": "default",
        "groupBy": [],
        "maxItems": 50,
        "sortOrder": 3,
        "dashboardAlerts": false,
        "alertName": "",
        "alertInstanceLabelFilter": "{tenant=~\"${tier}\", cluster=~\"${cluster:pipe}\", environment=~\"${environment:pipe}\", namespace=~\"${namespace:pipe}\", severity=~\"${severity:pipe}\"}",
        "datasource": "grafana",
        "stateFilter": {
          "firing": true,
          "pending": true,
          "noData": true,
          "normal": true,
          "error": true,
          "recovering": true
        },
        "showInstances": true,
        "folder": null
      },
      "repeat": "tier",
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "maxPerRow": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Needs attention",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "alertlist",
      "title": "${tier:text}: firing / pending",
      "description": "Alerts of this tier that are firing, pending (waiting out their 'for' period), have no data or failed to evaluate. Grouped by cluster.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 12
      },
      "options": {
        "viewMode": "list",
        "groupMode": "custom",
        "groupBy": [
          "cluster"
        ],
        "maxItems": 50,
        "sortOrder": 3,
        "dashboardAlerts": false,
        "alertName": "",
        "alertInstanceLabelFilter": "{tenant=~\"${tier}\", cluster=~\"${cluster:pipe}\", environment=~\"${environment:pipe}\", namespace=~\"${namespace:pipe}\", severity=~\"${severity:pipe}\"}",
        "datasource": "grafana",
        "stateFilter": {
          "firing": true,
          "pending": true,
          "noData": true,
          "normal": false,
          "error": true,
          "recovering": true
        },
        "showInstances": true,
        "folder": null
      },
      "repeat": "tier",
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "maxPerRow": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "alertlist",
      "title": "Critical only (selected tiers)",
      "description": "Alerts labelled severity=critical: node NotReady, metrics / logs stopped arriving, hub volume over 90%.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "viewMode": "list",
        "groupMode": "custom",
        "groupBy": [
          "cluster"
        ],
        "maxItems": 50,
        "sortOrder": 3,
        "dashboardAlerts": false,
        "alertName": "",
        "alertInstanceLabelFilter": "{tenant=~\"${tier:pipe}\", cluster=~\"${cluster:pipe}\", environment=~\"${environment:pipe}\", namespace=~\"${namespace:pipe}\", severity=\"critical\"}",
        "datasource": "grafana",
        "stateFilter": {
          "firing": true,
          "pending": true,
          "noData": true,
          "normal": false,
          "error": true,
          "recovering": true
        },
        "showInstances": true,
        "folder": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Jump to a cluster",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Clusters in the selected tier (click a cluster name for its dashboards and alert rules)",
      "description": "Live list of the spoke clusters matching Tier and Cluster. The hub has no cluster dashboards; see the link below.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "count by (cluster, tenant) (label_replace(up{__tenant_id__=~\"${tier:pipe}\", __tenant_id__!=\"aauti-hub\", cluster=~\"${cluster:pipe}\"}, \"tenant\", \"$1\", \"__tenant_id__\", \"(.+)\"))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "cluster": 0,
              "tenant": 1
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "left"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "cluster"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Cluster health",
                    "url": "/d/${__data.fields.tenant}-cluster-health/x?var-cluster=${__data.fields.cluster}&${__url_time_range}",
                    "targetBlank": false
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "Workloads & logs",
                    "url": "/d/${__data.fields.tenant}-workloads-logs/x?var-cluster=${__data.fields.cluster}&${__url_time_range}",
                    "targetBlank": false
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "Resource usage",
                    "url": "/d/${__data.fields.tenant}-resource-usage/x?var-cluster=${__data.fields.cluster}&${__url_time_range}",
                    "targetBlank": false
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "All dashboards of this cluster (incl. Jitsi Meet)",
                    "url": "/dashboards?tag=${__data.fields.tenant}",
                    "targetBlank": false
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "Alert rules of this cluster",
                    "url": "/alerting/list?search=label:cluster%3D${__data.fields.cluster}",
                    "targetBlank": false
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Cluster (click)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "tenant"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Tenant"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 2
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Hub (`aauti-hub-as1-obs-gke`): [Aauti-hub alert rules](/alerting/list?search=label:cluster%3Daauti-hub-as1-obs-gke) \u00b7 [Explore, product aauti-hub](/d/explore/explore?var-product=aauti-hub&from=now-6h&to=now)"
      }
    }
  ]
}